questions.question:
The sticky cart bar updates on scroll:

```js
window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
  bar.style.transform = `translateY(${Math.min(0, lastY - window.scrollY)}px)`;
  lastY = window.scrollY;
  shadow.hidden = bar.getBoundingClientRect().top < 0;
});
```

```text
Performance: scroll handler 118 calls/s, each with "Recalculate Style" + "Layout" (forced reflow)
```

Statement: "Reading `getBoundingClientRect()` right after writing a style forces a synchronous layout on every scroll event; doing the work once per frame in a `requestAnimationFrame` callback, with a passive listener, removes it."
